Package: Butterfly
Type: Package
Title: Robust Correlation Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Maxwell Konnaris
Maintainer: Maxwell Konnaris <Maxwellkonnaris@gmail.com>
Description: A package for running simulations and robust correlation analysis on count data using a bootstrap scale estimation approach to solve partially identified systems.
License: GPL-3
Imports: tidyverse, driver, rBeta2009, pbapply, progress


